    <div class="footer-brand">
      <a href="/" class="logo-container">
        <TongueLogo />
        <div class="logo-text">
            <span>Decoding</span>
            <span>The Burn</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <p>Documenting my personal journey, self-experiments, and data-driven research to understand and stop Burning Mouth Syndrome.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-column">
      <h4>Navigate</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog/how-i-solved-my-burning-mouth-syndrome/">My Story</a></li>
        <li><a href="/podcast">Podcast</a></li>
        <li><a href="/podcast/about">About the Podcast</a></li>
        <li><a href="/open-science">Open Science</a></li>
        <li><a href="/mission">Our Mission</a></li>
        <li><a href="/follow">Follow Us</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@DecodingTheBurning?sub_confirmation=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YouTube</a></li>
        <li><a href="/research">Research</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact">Ask a Question</a></li>
        <li><a href="/join">Participate</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

