    <p><strong>⚕️ Medical Disclaimer:</strong> The information I share on this website documents my personal health journey, self-experiments, and research. It is educational and informational only, and not intended as medical advice. Always seek the advice of your physician or qualified medical provider with any questions regarding a health condition.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <p>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} Decoding The Burn • Denis Ethier. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-disclaimer {
    background: #fffbeb;
    border-top: 1px solid #fde68a;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #fde68a;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #78350f;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .footer-disclaimer strong {
    color: #b45309;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
